{"id":"4d5d9a828cab1327","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-finite-type-choice-principles.md","title":"有限类型的选择、前提独立与 Markov 模式","display":"df-finite-type-choice-principles — 有限类型的选择、前提独立与 Markov 模式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles","aliases":["72-df-finite-type-choice-principles"],"display":"df-finite-type-choice-principles — 有限类型的选择、前提独立与 Markov 模式","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §2.3 principles AC, IP′, MP′, print347/PDF359","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source schemata and variable restrictions checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-finite-type-choice-principles"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-finite-type-choice-principles</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-type-choice-principles — 有限类型的选择、前提独立与 Markov 模式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §2.3 principles AC, IP′, MP′, print347/PDF359"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source schemata and variable restrictions checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>类型、带类型变量、公式及捕获避免代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4e2c27ac178897e\" href=\"?note=b4e2c27ac178897e\" title=\"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic\">72-df-finite-type-arithmetic</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{Ty}\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{Ty}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^\\sigma,y^\\tau,F^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}\">\\(x^\\sigma,y^\\tau,F^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}\\)</span> 为互异适型变量，F 不在 A 的自由变量中；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>IP′ 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\forall\\vec z\\theta\">\\(B=\\forall\\vec z\\theta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\forall\\vec v\\eta\">\\(A=\\forall\\vec v\\eta\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathcal Q\">\\(\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathcal Q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec z,\\vec v\">\\(\\vec z,\\vec v\\)</span> 是有限适型变量表，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(B)\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\)</span>；MP′ 的 x 可取任意有限类型。每个公理模式保留未显示的自由参数，作为开放公式模式，不在此预设扩充理论的证明关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(A)&amp;:=(\\forall x^\\sigma\\exists y^\\tau A)\\to\n\\exists F^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}\\forall x^\\sigma A[Fx/y],\\\\\n\\operatorname{IP}_{y}(B,A)&amp;:=(B\\to\\exists y^\\tau A)\\to\\exists y^\\tau(B\\to A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MP}_{x}(\\theta)&amp;:=\\neg\\forall x^\\sigma\\theta\\to\\exists x^\\sigma\\neg\\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(A)&amp;:=(\\forall x^\\sigma\\exists y^\\tau A)\\to\n\\exists F^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}\\forall x^\\sigma A[Fx/y],\\\\\n\\operatorname{IP}_{y}(B,A)&amp;:=(B\\to\\exists y^\\tau A)\\to\\exists y^\\tau(B\\to A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MP}_{x}(\\theta)&amp;:=\\neg\\forall x^\\sigma\\theta\\to\\exists x^\\sigma\\neg\\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>IP′ 按原书的前件与结论均取全称无量词矩阵型，且提取变量不自由出现在前件；更宽的公式模式需要另行推导，不能作为本条已核验的源模式。MP′ 允许高类型变量，与通常数类型的 Markov 原理应分开。这里给出明确公式构造器，未把这些模式当作原基础直觉主义逻辑已经可证的公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-type-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"类型、带类型变量、公式及捕获避免代入取 [[72-df-finite-type-arithmetic]]。$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{Ty}$，$x^\\sigma,y^\\tau,F^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}$ 为互异适型变量，F 不在 A 的自由变量中；$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega$，$\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{Ty}","display":false},{"tex":"x^\\sigma,y^\\tau,F^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\forall\\vec z\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\forall\\vec v\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\eta\\in\\mathcal Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec z,\\vec v","display":false},{"tex":"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(A)&:=(\\forall x^\\sigma\\exists y^\\tau A)\\to\n\\exists F^{\\sigma\\to\\tau}\\forall x^\\sigma A[Fx/y],\\\\\n\\operatorname{IP}_{y}(B,A)&:=(B\\to\\exists y^\\tau A)\\to\\exists y^\\tau(B\\to A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MP}_{x}(\\theta)&:=\\neg\\forall x^\\sigma\\theta\\to\\exists x^\\sigma\\neg\\theta.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2220,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] · [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice]] · [[72-thm-two-round-no-counterexample]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] · [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice]] · [[72-thm-two-round-no-counterexample]]"},{"id":"d26d12747335da16","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q$，x:σ 为指定变量；$P:=\\operatorname{MP}_x(\\theta)$ 使用 [[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]]。Dialectica 使用 [[72-df-dialectica-translation]]，并要求 $w(\\theta)=c(\\theta)=\\langle\\rangle$；a:σ 为新鲜挑战变量。类型、封闭项集与 $T_0$ 同该翻译所用的有限类型算术。"},{"id":"5fa65e4ea7ccdaff","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\theta\\in\\mathcal Q$，x:σ、y:τ 为指定变量，F:σ→τ 为新鲜变量；$P:=\\operatorname{AC}_{x,y,F}(\\theta)$ 使用 [[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]]。不要求 $w(\\theta),c(\\theta)$ 为空。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-516","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增5项：[[72-df-finite-type-choice-principles]] · [[72-df-two-round-no-counterexample-interpretation]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-markov-matrix]] · [[72-ex-dialectica-quantifier-free-choice]] · [[72-thm-two-round-no-counterexample]]"}],"outgoing":["b4e2c27ac178897e"]}